## Design Tokens

**IMPORTANT:** The complete token list lives in `design-tokens.all.css` at the project root.
ALWAYS read this file before generating any CSS, Tailwind classes, or component styling code.
Import it in `globals.css` at the top of every prototype:

```css
@import "../design-tokens.all.css";
```

The file includes light mode (`:root`), dark mode (`[data-mode="dark"]`), and system-preference support (`@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)`).

---

## Token Naming Convention

All tokens follow: `--tds-{category}-{subcategory}-{variant}`

| Category | What it covers | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| `color-surface-*` | Backgrounds — elevations, brand, danger, selected, neutral, inverse, disabled | `--tds-color-surface-elevation-0-default`, `--tds-color-surface-brand-default` |
| `color-content-*` | Text and icon colours | `--tds-color-content-primary`, `--tds-color-content-error` |
| `color-stroke-*` | Borders, focus rings, dividers | `--tds-color-stroke-subtle`, `--tds-color-stroke-focus` |
| `color-data-*` | Data visualisation — categorical, diverging, optimizer | `--tds-color-data-categorial-1`, `--tds-color-data-diverging-positive-plain` |
| `color-arbitrary-*` | Decorative palette (blue, teal, green, yellow, orange, red, magenta, lime, purple, cyan, neutral) with shades 1–4 | `--tds-color-arbitrary-blue-3` |
| `spacing-*` | Spacing scale (xs → 11xl) and semantic spacing tokens | `--tds-spacing-lg`, `--tds-spacing-vertical-between-sections` |
| `radius-*` | Border radii — scale (xs → full) and semantic tokens | `--tds-radius-sm`, `--tds-radius-cards-lg` |
| `text-style-*` | Font shorthand — label, body, heading, display sizes | `--tds-text-style-heading-md`, `--tds-text-style-body-sm` |
| `stroke-weight-*` | Border widths — standard, highlight, module | `--tds-stroke-weight-standard` |
| `window-size-*` | Breakpoints (sm → 2xl) | `--tds-window-size-md` |
| `opacity-*` | Disabled and loading opacity | `--tds-opacity-disabled` |

